msgid "Simulations"
msgstr "Simulations"

msgid ""
"Interactive maths and science experiments: explore numbers, forces, light, "
"electricity, atoms, planets and life. Simulations by PhET Interactive "
"Simulations, University of Colorado Boulder, under CC BY 4.0; Kidux is not "
"connected with PhET."
msgstr ""
"Des expériences interactives de mathématiques et de sciences : explore les "
"nombres, les forces, la lumière, l'électricité, les atomes, les planètes "
"et le vivant. Simulations de PhET Interactive Simulations, Université du "
"Colorado à Boulder, sous licence CC BY 4.0 ; Kidux n'a aucun lien avec "
"PhET."

